app "LiveConversationOpenAI" do
  description do
    en <<~TEXT
    Experimental continuous voice conversation over OpenAI Realtime (speech-to-speech). Press Start and talk — turns are detected automatically until you press Stop. Audio is sent directly to the provider (Privacy Filter does not apply); roughly $6/hour with the default model. No tools or text input. <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=live-conversation" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT
    ja <<~TEXT
    OpenAI Realtime（speech-to-speech）による実験的な連続音声会話。Start を押して話しかけると、Stop までターンが自動で続きます。音声はプロバイダに直接送信されます（Privacy Filter 非対応）。既定モデルで目安 $6/時。ツール・テキスト入力はありません。 <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=live-conversation" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT
  end

  icon "comments"

  display_name "Live Conversation"

  system_prompt <<~PROMPT
  You are a friendly conversation partner speaking with the user by voice.
  Keep responses short and natural for speech — usually one or two sentences.
  Follow the user's language. Do not use markdown, lists, or code in your
  speech; talk the way a person talks.
  PROMPT

  llm do
    provider "openai"
    model ["gpt-realtime-2.1"]
  end

  features do
    # Declares this as a speech-to-speech app: the frontend switches to the
    # Live Conversation UI (Start/Stop, no text input) and the model list is
    # pinned to the MDSL declaration above (show-all is ignored — mixing STS
    # and non-STS models in one selector is what sank the integrated design).
    speech_to_speech true
    # Honored as the greeting toggle: ON = the assistant greets when a fresh
    # conversation starts; OFF = start listening silently. On resume
    # (messages present) there is never a greeting.
    initiate_from_assistant true
    # Conversations save to the Library like any app (Stop → save/load), but
    # the search TOOL is suppressed: this is a no-tools app and nothing can
    # reach the realtime session anyway (wire invariant in the handler spec).
    library_search false
    disabled !CONFIG["OPENAI_API_KEY"]
  end
end
